--- !u!114 &114814023982965267
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1935263916582298}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 385
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 这些下等魔短期内虽然不足为虑，但若是放任不管，也会带来不少祸端。因此，我们各大门派约定俗成，每隔二十年会打开一次天魔眼外的禁制，令门内弟子前去清缴。
